        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Data Flow Diagram (DFD Level 1) - Chatio System\n\n&#39; Actors &amp; Boundaries\nactor \&quot;User / Browser\&quot; as User\nagent \&quot;TRUST BOUNDARY\\n(Client / Server)\&quot; as TrustBoundary\n\n&#39; Processes\nnode \&quot;1.0 Authentication &amp; Session\&quot; as P1\nnode \&quot;2.0 Messaging Service\&quot; as P2\nnode \&quot;3.0 File Management\&quot; as P3\nnode \&quot;4.0 Audit Logging\&quot; as P4\nnode \&quot;5.0 Backup &amp; Recovery\&quot; as P5\n\n&#39; Data Stores\ndatabase \&quot;D1: PostgreSQL DB\&quot; as D1\ndatabase \&quot;D2: Safe File Storage (uploads/)\&quot; as D2\ndatabase \&quot;D3: Audit Logs (logs/)\&quot; as D3\ndatabase \&quot;D4: Encrypted Backups (backups/)\&quot; as D4\n\n&#39; Flow 1: Auth\nUser --&gt; P1 : (1) Login Request (HTTPS POST)\nP1 --&gt; User : (2) Session Cookie (HttpOnly, Secure)\nP1 --&gt; D1 : Query User Hash/Salt (Argon2id)\nP1 --&gt; P4 : Trigger Auth Event Log\n\n&#39; Flow 2: Messaging\nUser --&gt; P2 : (3) Send Message (Socket.IO / HTTPS + CSRF)\nP2 --&gt; User : (4) Broadcast Message / ACK\nP2 --&gt; D1 : Validate Session &amp; Group Membership\nP2 --&gt; D1 : Save Message (Parameterized SQL)\n\n&#39; Flow 3: File Handling\nUser --&gt; P3 : (5) Upload File / Download Request\nP3 --&gt; User : (6) File Stream / Denied Error\nP3 --&gt; D1 : Check File Metadata &amp; Download Rights\nP3 --&gt; D2 : Save/Read Binary File (GUID Name)\nP3 --&gt; P4 : Log Access Denied Attempts\n\n&#39; Internal Logging\nP4 --&gt; D3 : Append Audit Log (No Passwords/Tokens)\n\n&#39; Flow 5: Backup\nP5 --&gt; D1 : Read DB Records\nP5 --&gt; D2 : Read File Blobs\nP5 --&gt; D4 : Store Encrypted Backup Archives\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="PmvYf-EgNpNVUzWCh5Wz-43">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
